{
  "title": "IELTS API: a free, no-authentication REST API and open dataset for IELTS preparation research",
  "description": "Archived release of the IELTS API source code and datasets. Cite this record, or the version-specific DOI, when you use the API or the datasets in research. The datasets include a mock-exam test-centre index derived from the YYSD IELTS online mock-exam test center, and the service ships a self-testing toolkit with an Ebbinghaus spaced-repetition scheduler, seeded vocabulary quizzes, a mistake taxonomy and an indicative writing scorer.",
